{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_07",
  "title": "有客先来",
  "storyCode": "RI-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "749ea8b0b428f302529a8e81e44365ebb27291386b34605bf50da738babdfa8a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "居然有这么强的整合运动，哼，但是小刻不会输的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "啧，这个傻丫头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "唔？这里是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "啊，是嘉维尔！还有大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "早上好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "诶嘿嘿，博士早上好。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "唔，博士的脸色有点可怕，是我做错了什么吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "博士不要生气好不好......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（爆栗）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "呜呜呜，头好痛，博士。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "为什么突然敲我的头呀......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "精神看起来至少恢复正常了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "小刻，你还记得你怎么来到这里的吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "......唔，忘了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "来，你先躺下，我给你看看身体还有没有出问题，还有下次别乱跑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "好~咦，这里是哪里啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这里是......啧，不知道怎么给你解释，反正躺好就对了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "哦——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你在搞什么鬼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啧，给你解释也很麻烦，总之你先等等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "十分钟后"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好了，没什么大碍，去博士旁边待着，别乱跑啊，再乱跑不给你蜜饼吃了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "哦！蜜饼！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "可以了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "可以了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "那么，嘉维尔，你在搞什么鬼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "唉，说起来有些复杂，总之我是来找你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "引擎我是不会还给你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "虽然引擎也是一件事，不过我有别的事要找你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "别的事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你是不是让手下去开采铁矿了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......啧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉维尔，我没想到你是这么不服输的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "被大丑打败让你不服气吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "不，那个叫大丑的东西确实不赖，我心服口服。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "但如果你不惜让手下染上矿石病也要去开采矿石的话，那我作为医生，就必须要阻止你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯？矿石病？哦，你在说石头病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我没有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我告诉过他们很多次不要靠近矿区深处。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "可是你的手下明明感染了矿石病！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "会有不听话的家伙跑进去，这个我拦不住，你说是吧，尤吉？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
          "text": "是，哥哥是想多给大酋长采一些矿才冒险跑进矿区深处的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？那你早说啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
          "text": "你又没问。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这么重要的事......！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你自己说的，矿石病在这里不被重视。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "啧，好吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，我该不会真的没问吧？！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你确实没问。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "啧，博士，连你也拆我的台！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "而且......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，你干嘛突然脱衣服？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？！你的身体......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我从小就一直在矿区里到处跑，会得石头病也是很正常的事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "但是，我也敢说，没有人比我更了解矿区里哪里有那种会让人得病的矿石。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "这样啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧，那是我错怪你了，抱歉哈，祖玛玛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "没事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "诶，就这么和解了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "一般这种情况不是应该互不相让然后大战三百回合的吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可颂",
          "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
          "text": "别期待这种事啦！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉维尔不是那种人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可惜。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那我们来聊聊另一件事吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我们的引擎在你这里对吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那个能不能还给我们？不然的话我可要回不去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "你想回去的话，我可以让人送你一程。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那可不行，凯尔希会生气的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "无论如何都不行？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "无论如何都不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "哦，看起来还是要打诶。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "看起来还是要动手啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我从一开始就是这个打算。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘿，要和这家伙打一场吗，有意思！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗨，你们好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......大祭司，你怎么这就把大丑开出来了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "什么，不是要和嘉维尔动手吗？不用吗？不用我就开回去了，我还要测试引擎呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......要，但不是现在，我还有话要说。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，好吧，那你先说，要打了喊我！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，刚才你们是不是提到了引擎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "没错，大丑身上现在就装着你的引擎，想要的话，就用你的武力来抢吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘿，那就来吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "跟我来，我们在广场上决出胜负。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
